    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <p>We need to deliver the technical integration of Pega Voice AI through Audiohook, providing the architecture, infrastructure, and readiness required for future voice-driven business capabilities. The scope includes establishing secure audio streaming, configuring APIs, and ensuring compliance with enterprise standards.</p>
            <br/>
        </td>
    </tr>
    </table>

    <br/>

