        <tr id="comment-body-6752816"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Hi <a href="https://blueshieldca.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" class="user-hover" rel="712020:29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" data-account-id="712020:29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" accountid="712020:29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" rel="noreferrer">Andres Hermosilla</a>  - Voice AI does not store any PHI, Voice AI is able to listen to the call, but, it does not store any of this information.</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-6758459"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
