        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-6759141"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>Hi <a href="https://blueshieldca.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" class="user-hover" rel="712020:29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" data-account-id="712020:29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" accountid="712020:29ceda5d-44f6-48d1-be14-66b762c73041" rel="noreferrer">Andres Hermosilla</a>  - Voice AI is able to listen to the call, which means it can access PHI during the conversation. However, it does not retain or store any of this information after the call ends. This ensures that while Voice AI processes the audio in real time, no PHI is saved or kept within the system.</p>
        </td></tr>
